<title>UK: TABLE-Grand Met H1 pretax pre-excepts rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Grand Met H1 pretax pre-excepts rises.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to March 31</p>
<p>		   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		13.3		   vs 14.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 6.25		   vs 5.85</p>
<p> Pretax		     428		    vs 449</p>
<p> Turnover		   4,309		  vs 4,551</p>
<p>NOTE - Above results include exceptionals.</p>
<p>Excluding exceptionals, pretax profit was 471 million stg, up 3.5 percent from the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 461.0 and 477.0 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Grand Metropolitan Plc. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
